**Why revolutionary:** 270+ practices, each scored in real-time against 8 dimensions of user state. The *specific weight combinations* are proprietary. This is why two users at Band 3 get completely different sessions.

### Engine 3: Adaptive Engine (The Crown Jewel)
**Per-turn AI directive generation:**
```
User Message → computeState() → detectEdgeCases() → detectStage(0-7) 
  → routeAgents(2-3) → decideInsightDepth() → decideRevealLevel(1-4)
